[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天起了大早来看望蓝。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10290"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10252"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼哇……啊呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看上去很困的样子呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10231"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……习惯了啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话是这么说……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然现在还是上午，苍已经困的哈欠连连了。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1140"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"昨天晚上苍可以说是干劲十足。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过也是理所当然的，毕竟发现了能让蓝醒过来的方法。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1142"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘让我看看你的记忆吧……’"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1153"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天已经看了7只左右的七影蝶的记忆，但依旧没有蓝的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过她完全没有气馁的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不如说，现在她的表情充满了活力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是――……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她还是没有告诉我，“吕字”那到底是怎么回事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而现在，苍――……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1152"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚才还在像往常一样，对着沉睡中的蓝述说着最近发生的琐事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一不留神，她自己也开始打起了瞌睡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最近经常像这样突然断了电似的打瞌睡。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“简直像是孩子呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但昨天应该没有弄得很晚才对……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许是积累了太多疲劳吧？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……蓝……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“蓝……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像是梦话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……等着我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我绝对……会找……到蝴蝶的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“一定会……让你……醒过来的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……边睡边说的人会有说服力吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不禁地苦笑道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然，感觉自己的视野边角上有种异样感。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1156"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着睡着的蓝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……她，在笑？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一直昏迷不醒的蓝的嘴角浮现出淡淡的微笑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"像是在回应苍的呓语一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊，是吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确实，苍有说过。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1145"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘现在看上去，就像只是睡着了一样吧？’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘事实也确实是这样就是了。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘但是，她偶尔也会有露出其他的表情，又或是移动自己的手。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘虽然医生说，这只是正常的肌肉反射运动而已……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘但是我相信，蓝一定是在努力地想要和我说话。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘想要回应我平时和她聊的那些许多许多的事情……’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"‘我是这么想的。’"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1156"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"的确像她所说的一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍的努力，蓝的确是感受到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使在睡梦之中，两人的牵绊也从未断绝。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么一想后，我也变得开心起来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我坐在原地，观望着两人的睡脸。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"睡着的样子，两人真是一模一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，还有一样两人共通的部分在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，应该说是共通的东西吧。"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":106,"value":["==",["v",91],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个叫做琉璃珠的来着？”"},{"op":"goto","target":107},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是一样的玻璃球呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍一直戴在头发上的，小小的装饰品。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而在蓝的手腕上，同样也绑着同样的装饰。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和苍平时戴着的相比，蓝手腕上的珠子显得略微逊色。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"通过身上携带着的一样的东西，让两人互相保持着联系。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许这饰物有着这样的意义在也不一定。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“…呼……呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说话，熟悉的睡颜又多了一个啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着她的睡颜，可以说已经成为了我的日常。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i170"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到了晚上，我和苍来到了山中。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10524"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼哇……啊呼……好困……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你今天几乎一天都在睡吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10509"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我也没有办法啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10510"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“困就是困嘛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“打哈欠是没关系啦，记得注意脚下。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10461"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“知道的啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10435"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呜哇哇……!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不出意外，苍在地面隆起的地方绊了一下。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎哟。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我立刻扶住了苍的身子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你看，我就说吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10591"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯，嗯……谢谢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要不要牵手？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10530"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……唉？手？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“会稍微安全一点吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10527"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……是呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10610"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯，牵手吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说是自己的提案，真的同意的时候却慌了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使如此，说出口的我也不能在这里打退堂鼓。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那……来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"轻轻地伸出了手。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10511"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯……拜托了～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍毫不犹豫握紧了我伸出的手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为睡魔的关系，导致判断力低下了吧？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“下次，早上村里散步的时候也牵手试试看不？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10486"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“才不要呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10562"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那……超级难为情的不是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那现在就不难为情吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10569"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“现在没人在看啦……嗯，没事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样的吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10545"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯，就是这样。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10669"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知是不是为了留给我俩空间，稻荷开始走在我们的身前。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10695"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"背向着我们，大大地甩了一下自己的尾巴。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10675"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘――放手去做吧’如是说道一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这只狐狸实在是太懂事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也为了回应稻荷的这份心意，我回握住了苍的手。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10608"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……痛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……对不起……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"女孩子的手，比我想象中还要瘦小。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使在与体内的睡魔进行斗争之余，苍也继续完成着自己的使命。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在稻荷的引导之下，今天也接触了好几只七影蝶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，其中也依然没有发现蓝的记忆。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10525"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼哇……啊呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人间紧握的手上也能感觉到，苍回握的力量在逐渐变弱。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍的睡意也差不多到极限了的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10527"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍，稻荷好像发现了的样子，怎么办？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10542"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯――……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10495"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……再试最后一只……看看好了～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10510"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"摇晃着身子半合着眼皮，朝着着七影蝶的方向前进。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10427"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“来～吧～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为睡意的关系，动作都非常随意了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"七影蝶停在了苍随便挥出的右手之上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10596"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和平时一样，眼神中的感情开始消退。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而下一瞬间――"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……啊……啊啊啊啊……！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10604"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍？怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10595"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……这是……不能看的记忆……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10604"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“要给占据了……被记忆……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍非常痛苦地按着自己胸口。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10596"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“无法控制……感情了……压抑不住……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍唰唰地开始流泪。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这……不行……又悲伤又凄苦又寂寞的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，振作点！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到苍失去平衡了的样子，我立刻上前抱住了她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看到什么了!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10596"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“死亡……记忆……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这……这样的……呜哇……啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“羽依里……求你了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“就这样抱紧我……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不然的话，我……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“知道了！抱紧你就可以了对吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我张开双臂紧紧地抱住了苍的身子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10596"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“再用力点……痛也不要紧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“知，知道了……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我按照苍所说的，死死地抱住了她的身子。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10605"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呜呜……呜啊啊啊……呜，啊啊啊啊啊啊……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍的身子不停地在颤抖，贴在我的怀中哭泣着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的哭泣已不仅是在呜咽，而可以说是痛哭不已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"除了抱紧她之外，我就没其他事能做了吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当我被七影蝶的记忆所占据的时候，苍是怎样帮我的来着？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……苍…！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事的……你是苍，空门苍……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"呼唤着她的名字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍！别被记忆给左右了！你还有必须要完成的事在才对！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍！苍！苍！苍！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊啊啊啊……呜啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊……！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍……！加油！苍！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紧紧抱住苍的身子，不断地呼唤着她的名字。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"懊悔着除此之外无能为力的自己。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在那之后，到底过去了多少时间呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……苍。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10447"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"停住哭泣的苍，不知什么时候已在我怀中沉沉睡去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脸颊上还留着带着温度的泪痕。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10694"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稻荷在我的脚边，一脸担心似的抬头望着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事的，稻荷。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"继续抱着苍，我慢慢地在原地坐了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将苍的身子轻放在地面上后，把自己的膝盖枕在她的头下。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10692"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“啾……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稻荷立刻便走到了苍的身边，开始唰唰地舔着脸上的泪痕。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最近都没遇到会产生恶劣影响的记忆，所以放松了警惕。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原本，虽然在程度上有所区别，但七影蝶或多或少都残留有负面的感情在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她那么多次强调了，接触七影蝶是多么危险的事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也亲身体验过了不是吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说苍是在执行空门家的使命，但同时也是在接触他人的记忆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"凄苦的记忆所带来的凄苦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"悲伤的记忆所带来的悲伤。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而七影蝶，则会不管三七二十一的让人体验这一切。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“很难受吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使是为了蓝，苍所付出的牺牲也实在是太大了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，苍是不会住手的吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一定会继续勉强自己。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊，是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我选择和她在一起，也许能帮到苍一点也不一定。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"比如，像现在这样被危险的记忆所左右的时候。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"能为苍维持住自己的意识多少发挥点作用。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10683"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“……嘭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然稻荷向着远处叫唤了一声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“稻荷？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……在那里吗？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝着稻荷看着的方向望去，发现一只七影蝶正在飘飘地飞向这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蝴蝶毫不理会灯笼，笔直地飞向我们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……怎么办？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"既然发现了，那应该去接触才对吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是苍现在处于这样的状态，万一是危险的记忆的话该怎么办……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是我受影响的话也就算了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果这个记忆会导致苍他们受到危害，而我又被其左右了的话……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不，但是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是苍一直在寻找的蓝记忆的可能性……也不能否定。"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"碰触七影蝶","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"不碰触七影蝶","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":416,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……要是能帮到苍的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下定决心后，看向七影蝶。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“稻荷……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10634"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“万一出什么事情的话，你就狠狠地咬我一口。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10632"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总比没有好，也算是保险了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我向蝴蝶伸出手。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……来吧，让我看看你的记忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"蝴蝶飘飘地飞舞在周围。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"飘啊飘……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……来吧……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"　　飘啊飘……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……让我见识你的记忆吧……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i442"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"　　　　飘啊飘……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"七影蝶无视我伸出的手，消失在了森林深处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我就这么伸着手僵在了原地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下定了老大的决心，正准备卖帅的时候，忽然感觉尴尬的不行。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10676"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"稻荷像是在说不要紧一般，前腿轻轻地拍打着我的小腿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……谢了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍睡着没看见实在是太好了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没再让她继续看记忆，和没让她看到我这逊样的双重意义。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我安心地深呼吸了口气。"},{"op":"set","variable":96,"value":1},{"op":"goto","target":451},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不行，不能碰。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随意触碰导致受到伤害的可能不只我一个，还是不碰为妙。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"七影蝶所给人的意志所带来的影响力我早已经亲身体会过了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"万一出什么事的时候，没有能阻止的人在身边实在是太危险了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10447"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，苍她……总是一个人在做着这样的事情吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"即使是为了搭救自己双胞胎的姐姐也好，这过程也实在是太过于艰苦残酷了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……但是，她既然同意让我陪着她来到这山林里，也就是她已经信赖我了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然知道现在不是时候，但内心却也感到一丝高兴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但，正因为这样，我才更应该报答她的信赖才行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在必须做的，并非冒险。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而是确保苍的安全。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i234"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，你别过来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也不知道对方是否听的懂我说的话，但依然向飘忽而来的七影蝶大声喝到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"七影蝶既不离开也不附和，只是和我们继续保持着一定的距离。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"过了好一会儿后，重要慢慢地飞离了我们。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i46"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我也没有任何的放松，将目光锁定在飞远的七影蝶上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"直到完全失去其踪影为止。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……呼……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将自己的呼吸恢复正常，刚才甚至不敢喘大气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白白紧张了。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10445"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍在我的膝盖上安稳地睡着。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了她的话，我想做到一切力所能及的事情。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]